PODFoam: optional podSvdInterval in controlDict

At its default of 0 nothing changes: a write step runs the SVD if
snapshots have been collected since the last SVD, and collects one
otherwise. Above 0, every step collects a snapshot and the SVD runs
every podSvdInterval snapshots. An SVD on a step that writes nothing
else makes a time folder with only the mode files. A negative value
stops the run with a message. Each step now prints a Time = line with
its deltaT; the timing lines stay.

